Rep. JC M. Abalos: tungkol sa RPVARA o ang tinatawag nating Real Property Assessment and Valuation and Assessment Reform Act.

1315
01:18:26,180 --> 01:18:30,440
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Mr. Speaker, Republic Act No. 12001,

1316
01:18:30,960 --> 01:18:34,960
Rep. JC M. Abalos: otherwise known as the Real Property Valuation and Assessment Reform Act,

1317
01:18:35,200 --> 01:18:41,820
Rep. JC M. Abalos: was enacted to modernize and standardize the country's real property valuation and assessment system,

1318
01:18:42,540 --> 01:18:45,640
Rep. JC M. Abalos: promote transparency, improve tax administration,

1319
01:18:46,220 --> 01:18:50,500
Rep. JC M. Abalos: and strengthen fiscal capacity of local government units.

1320
01:18:51,020 --> 01:18:55,360
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Mr. Speaker, while the objectives of the law remain worthy and necessary,

1321
01:18:56,020 --> 01:19:10,660
Rep. JC M. Abalos: This representation believes that we have the continuing duty to ensure that the implementation remains responsive to prevailing economic realities and does not result in unintended burdens upon the Filipino people.

1322
01:19:10,660 --> 01:19:20,100
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Mr. Speaker, mula noong naisabatas natin ang RPVARA, mula noon hanggang ngayon, nagbago na po ang economic realities na hinaharap ng ating bansa.

1323
01:19:20,100 --> 01:19:28,160
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Noong ito ay naipasa, hindi pa po nangyari ang Middle East oil crisis at hindi pa po ganun kasama ang inflation.

1324
01:19:28,880 --> 01:19:47,920
Rep. JC M. Abalos: If I may add po, Mr. Speaker, nag-file po tayo ng House Resolution noong nakaraang July kung saan nananawagan po tayo na panahon na po siguro na reviewhin natin ang RPVARA at aralin po natin kung napapanahon po ba ito or kung kakailanganin siyang suspindihin.

1325
