1331
01:20:41,200 --> 01:20:46,440
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At ito rin po ang naging rekomendasyon ng Private Sector Advisory Council.

1332
01:20:46,860 --> 01:20:49,200
Rep. JC M. Abalos: That being said, Mr. Speaker, gusto ko po malaman...

1333
