2559
02:30:08,340 --> 02:30:10,200
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: para po mabudgetan

2560
02:30:10,200 --> 02:30:11,900
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: yung pangangailangan ng ating

2561
02:30:11,900 --> 02:30:13,980
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: mga mamamayan. Pagdating naman po

2562
02:30:13,980 --> 02:30:15,940
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: doon sa paano

2563
02:30:15,940 --> 02:30:17,960
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: madetermine ang pondo

2564
02:30:17,960 --> 02:30:20,000
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: sa NEP, kaya ang Department of Finance

2565
