Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: with its board possibly designating half of its current budget for more rapid disbursement

4600
04:31:23,760 --> 04:31:24,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: through a simplified

4601
04:31:24,800 --> 04:31:26,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: application process and project cycle.

4602
04:31:27,440 --> 04:31:30,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Fifth and sixth class municipalities in particular,

4603
04:31:31,160 --> 04:31:35,020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: projected to be hard-hit by the Super El Niño should be prioritized,

4604
04:31:35,380 --> 04:31:39,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: especially in implementing projects such as rainwater harvesting,

4605
04:31:39,660 --> 04:31:42,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: crop diversification, and watershed management.

4606
04:31:43,000 --> 04:31:47,420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, magbibigay naman po tayo ng list of recommendations at the proper time.

4607
04:31:47,820 --> 04:31:52,500
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yes, we appreciate, Mrs. Speaker, itong mga namimention po na recommendation

4608
04:31:52,500 --> 04:31:56,300
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ng kinatawan ng kabataan party list.

4609
04:31:56,380 --> 04:32:01,920
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: In fact, ang position po ng DOF ay nais po nilang makakuha itong recommendation na ito

4610
04:32:01,920 --> 04:32:09,460
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: nang sa ganun ay maging basihan din po ito sa ongoing improvement po sa Social People's Protection Fund na ito po,

4611
04:32:09,520 --> 04:32:10,340
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

4612
04:32:10,440 --> 04:32:16,680
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So, nagpapasalamat po kami and then the DOF is willing to work with Congresswoman Renee Co

4613
04:32:16,680 --> 04:32:21,260
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: para po mas mapa-improve pa natin, mas papadali at mas matulungan natin ang mga komunidad

4614
04:32:21,260 --> 04:32:22,380
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ngangailangan.

4615
04:32:22,380 --> 04:32:27,760
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ng ganitong klaseng pondo para po sa proteksyon, hindi lang po ng kalakasan nila

4616
04:32:27,760 --> 04:32:31,700
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: pero proteksyon po sa kanilang mga constituents, Mrs. Speaker, Your Honor.

4617
04:32:32,240 --> 04:32:33,940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Salamat po, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

4618
04:32:34,420 --> 04:32:38,660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang sunod po nating tanong ay tungkol naman po sa Bureau of Customs.

4619
04:32:38,760 --> 04:32:47,800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito po ay tungkol naman din sa usapin ng electronic waste na nakita natin na tinambak sa Subic

4620
04:32:47,800 --> 04:32:52,060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: some 253, if I remember correctly,

4621
04:32:52,380 --> 04:33:08,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: containers of that, na nahirapan yung Bureau of Customs to exercise its mandate, legal mandate, para po tuloy-tuloy na ma-check yung anuman po yung nandito sa mga containers na ito.

4622
04:33:08,820 --> 04:33:30,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Noted po natin na nagkaroon po ng joint inspection on the nine recycling site, nine recycling locators in Subic, July 1 this year, kasama ng SBMA at DNRM EMD. Ano pong findings ng joint inspection na ito, Mr. Speaker, Good Sponsor?

4623
04:33:34,660 --> 04:33:38,020
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Kung maaari lang po lamang, magre-refer lang po ako sa data.

4624
04:33:38,820 --> 04:34:08,000
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Pero alam ko, just while they're looking at the data, sa Bureau of Customs po, ito pong nami-mention po na mga, okay, ito pong mga e-waste na mga cargo po, for a certain period of time, kasi what is important po, Mr. Speaker, is hindi po nila dito tinatangbak.

4625
04:34:08,820 --> 04:34:13,300
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Pinapabalik po nila ito sa country of origin, Mr. Speaker.

4626
04:34:13,860 --> 04:34:38,460
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So kung meron man lang pong time na nandoon sa isang lugar, dyan po sa na-mention na lugar po ng ating kagalang-galang na kinatawan, ng kabataan party, this is only good for a certain number of days because it really requires that they need to be processed first and then makuha po yung number so that kailangan po yung documentation before the Bureau of Customs.

4627
04:34:38,820 --> 04:34:40,940
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: And it sends them back to the country of origin.

4628
04:34:42,100 --> 04:34:48,320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maaari na lang po bang humingi ng kopya ng report tungkol po sa findings of this joint inspection?

4629
04:34:48,320 --> 04:35:07,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero we raise this line of questioning, Madam Speaker, good sponsor, dahil po ang pagtambak ng e-waste, or rather, ang illegal importation of e-waste papuntang subik galing United States ay hindi po sang-ayon sa Basel Convention.

4630
04:35:07,500 --> 04:35:08,760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At under the Basel...

4631
04:35:08,820 --> 04:35:21,960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At under the Basel Convention na ating niratipika ay ang essentially agency na in charge sa pag-ensure na ito ay nasusunod other than the DEN or andyan ang Bureau of Customs.

4632
04:35:21,960 --> 04:35:38,800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So it's good to hear na itong July 1 and subsequent inspections ay napapabalik na po sa country of origin yung mga tunetuneladang mga e-waste na pumupunta.

4633
04:35:38,820 --> 04:35:47,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dito sa ating bansa, ayaw po natin na maging tambakan ng basura ang Pilipinas, gaya po ng ginagawa ng ibang mayamang bansa sa Southeast Asia.

4634
04:35:48,340 --> 04:36:02,960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, I'd like a commitment, Madam Speaker, good sponsor, on the floor, tuloy-tuloy na ba ang cooperation to ensure that illegal imports of electronic waste and toxic waste on the area is strictly prohibited under our law?

4635
04:36:03,660 --> 04:36:08,500
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yes, Mrs. Speaker, we can guarantee that we will call the support.

4636
04:36:08,820 --> 04:36:23,580
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yes, Mrs. Speaker, just to add on to the previous response that I gave to the good lady from Kabataan Party List, it's not only about Customs' role and duty to send back these e-waste cargos,

4637
04:36:24,020 --> 04:36:30,080
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: but even the DNR also requires them to have a clear position on this.

4638
04:36:30,180 --> 04:36:37,800
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: I think this is an ongoing discussion between the Bureau of Customs and the Department of Natural Resources and Environment and Natural Resources.

4639
04:36:37,800 --> 04:36:38,000
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yes.

4640
04:36:38,820 --> 04:36:59,480
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So on the part of the Customs, kaya nga po nagko-cause ito ng possible alarm sa environment as well as health environment, they send them back. But as to the position of the good lady, whether the Bureau of Customs stands on whatever treaties, agreements, international covenants that we have entered into,

4641
04:36:59,480 --> 04:37:08,060
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: definitely, we will keep solidly comply with whatever the directives from all these treaties and covenants.

4642
04:37:08,820 --> 04:37:11,440
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: I think the Philippine government has said, entered into, Mrs. Speaker, your Honor.

4643
04:37:11,780 --> 04:37:14,240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay, maraming salamat, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

4644
04:37:14,680 --> 04:37:26,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro ang huling na lang nating line of questioning din tungkol dito ay meron ding nakumpirma na containers na intercepted ng Bureau of Customs.

4645
04:37:26,600 --> 04:37:35,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron po noong July 25, and according to Inquirer, it contains scrap copper from the U.S. arrived aboard MV Tokyo Express.

4646
04:37:35,540 --> 04:37:38,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And meron din po isa pa na kinumpirma.

4647
04:37:38,820 --> 04:37:43,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng August 22 na suspected electronic waste.

4648
04:37:44,080 --> 04:37:45,740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And as far as we know, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor,

4649
04:37:45,820 --> 04:37:50,380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: wala pang inilalabas na report para sa ikalawang shipment na pinatigil.

4650
04:37:50,860 --> 04:37:54,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maari po bang malaman ano yung findings

4651
04:37:54,260 --> 04:37:58,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng other interceptions na ginawa ng Bureau of Customs?

4652
04:37:59,300 --> 04:38:00,980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At pwede po bang ikumpirma,

4653
04:38:01,380 --> 04:38:04,660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: electronic waste po ba ang laman ng shipments na ito?

4654
04:38:04,940 --> 04:38:06,080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At galing sa anong bansa?

4655
04:38:08,820 --> 04:38:38,800
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ...

4656
04:38:38,820 --> 04:38:48,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mrs. Speaker, apologies for that. Uh, Mr. Speaker, these are scrap metals upon assessment by the Bureau of Customs.

4657
04:38:49,820 --> 04:38:52,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Pero when they are being tested, I think electronically,

4658
04:38:53,700 --> 04:38:54,920
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: mayroon nagpa-positive siya.

4659
04:38:55,020 --> 04:38:58,680
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So I think these are the scrap metals used in hospitals,

4660
04:38:58,940 --> 04:39:02,080
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: maybe those devices that used radioactive.

4661
04:39:02,080 --> 04:39:07,080
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: That's why they're still continuing to...

4662
04:39:07,080 --> 04:39:08,080
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: still continuing...

4663
04:39:08,820 --> 04:39:10,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: They're still continuing on assessing these.

4664
04:39:10,820 --> 04:39:14,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So magbibigay na lang po daw ang Bureau of Customs ng report,

4665
04:39:14,820 --> 04:39:17,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: assessment report, patungkol po dito sa sinasa...

4666
04:39:17,820 --> 04:39:19,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: minimension po ng ating kagalang-galang na interpreter,

4667
04:39:19,820 --> 04:39:21,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mrs. Speaker, Your Honor.

4668
04:39:21,820 --> 04:39:23,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hintayin din po natin yung ulat na ito,

4669
04:39:23,820 --> 04:39:25,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero para po rin sa clarification,

4670
04:39:25,820 --> 04:39:29,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: galing po sa anong bansa itong ikalawa na shipment?

4671
04:39:30,820 --> 04:39:33,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Galing po ng United States po, Mrs. Speaker, Your Honor.

4672
04:39:33,820 --> 04:39:36,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Pero may iba-iba po na point of origin.

4673
04:39:38,820 --> 04:39:46,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Meron pong mga other European countries,

4674
04:39:46,820 --> 04:39:49,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: for example, those cargos,

4675
04:39:49,820 --> 04:39:51,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: e-waste cargos that came from the United States,

4676
04:39:51,820 --> 04:39:56,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: pinabalik na po natin yan sa country of origin.

4677
04:39:56,820 --> 04:39:59,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: But the other, it's still being assessed

4678
04:39:59,820 --> 04:40:01,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: and magbibigay po kami ng report,

4679
04:40:01,820 --> 04:40:04,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: kagalang-galang na interpreter, Mrs. Speaker, Your Honor.

4680
04:40:04,820 --> 04:40:06,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, hintayin po natin yung ulat

4681
04:40:06,820 --> 04:40:09,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at hingi rin po tayo ng ulat sa tatlong interceptions

4682
04:40:09,820 --> 04:40:11,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ginawa ng Bureau of Customs.

4683
04:40:11,820 --> 04:40:19,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Andiyan po yung sa July 1, July 25, and August 18.

4684
04:40:19,820 --> 04:40:23,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro to note na lang on the record, Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

4685
04:40:23,820 --> 04:40:28,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: under the Basel Ban Amendment na at tayo'y signatory din,

4686
04:40:28,820 --> 04:40:34,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi po maaari mag-export ang bansang U.S.

4687
04:40:34,820 --> 04:40:37,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: even ang mga bansa ng OECD,

4688
04:40:37,820 --> 04:40:39,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: so it includes European countries,

4689
04:40:39,820 --> 04:40:42,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa labas ng kanilang mga grupo.

4690
04:40:42,820 --> 04:40:44,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So hindi po pwede sa Pilipinas.

4691
04:40:44,820 --> 04:40:49,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So Madam Speaker, good sponsor, ang huli na lang nating tanong ay

4692
04:40:49,820 --> 04:40:54,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: alam natin na may RTC ruling na inalabas last year na nagsasabi

4693
04:40:54,820 --> 04:40:59,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ang Subic Bay Freeport Zone ay outside customs territory

4694
04:40:59,820 --> 04:41:03,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: over which public respondents, BOC, and POS can exercise jurisdiction.

4695
04:41:04,820 --> 04:41:09,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Has this impeded the mandate of the BOC to report and inspect suspicious

4696
04:41:09,820 --> 04:41:12,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and possibly illegal shipments within the SBMA?

4697
04:41:12,820 --> 04:41:15,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At naapektoan po ba nito ang nakaraang mga pagpatitigil

4698
04:41:15,820 --> 04:41:17,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga shipments of e-waste?

4699
04:41:19,820 --> 04:41:22,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Meron naman po, Mrs. Speaker, proper coordination

4700
04:41:22,820 --> 04:41:28,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ang Subic Free Zone, Mrs. Speaker, Your Honor,

4701
04:41:28,820 --> 04:41:33,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: at hindi naman po na-interrupt o naantala kung ano po yung mandatong

4702
04:41:33,820 --> 04:41:36,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: binigay po sa Bureau of Customs, Mrs. Speaker, Your Honor.

4703
04:41:36,820 --> 04:41:41,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So may proper coordination naman pong nangyayari at I would say na hindi po

4704
04:41:41,820 --> 04:41:49,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: both, narirespeto naman po yung mandato ng ating pangunahing ahensya

4705
04:41:49,820 --> 04:41:54,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: para po to make sure na yung pagpasok po dito sa ating bansa ng mga goods

4706
04:41:54,820 --> 04:41:58,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ay legal at hindi po dumaan sa mga iligal na pamamaraan,

4707
04:41:58,820 --> 04:41:59,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mrs. Speaker, Your Honor.

4708
04:41:59,820 --> 04:42:00,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you po.

4709
04:42:00,820 --> 04:42:02,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito na lang po ang huli nating mga tanong.

4710
04:42:02,820 --> 04:42:10,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tungkol naman po ito sa tax deduction sa mga negosyo dahil po sa batas na RA 10754

4711
04:42:10,820 --> 04:42:14,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: that expands the benefits and privileges of persons with disabilities.

4712
04:42:14,820 --> 04:42:18,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa PWD tax deduction ng mga establishments,

4713
04:42:18,820 --> 04:42:20,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor,

4714
04:42:20,820 --> 04:42:26,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: bukod sa kakulangan o hindi talaga pagsumite ng mga records of sales kasama ang mga pangalan

4715
04:42:26,820 --> 04:42:30,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng persons with disability, PWD ID,

4716
04:42:30,820 --> 04:42:32,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at kung applicable yung TIN nila,

4717
04:42:32,820 --> 04:42:40,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may iba po bang pwedeng rason kung bakit magdedisallow ang claim para sa tax deduction?

4718
04:42:58,820 --> 04:42:59,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mrs. Speaker, Your Honors,

4719
04:42:59,820 --> 04:43:05,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: sa palagay po namin under the BIR,

4720
04:43:05,820 --> 04:43:10,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: wala po namang mga cases wherein dinidisallow yung claim na lalo-lalo na po

4721
04:43:10,820 --> 04:43:15,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: by PWD because this is also enforcement ito po ng batas.

4722
04:43:15,820 --> 04:43:25,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Lahat po nang may mga exception, discounts na lalo-lalo na po itong mga persons with disability,

4723
04:43:25,820 --> 04:43:29,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ay dapat po talaga na magkaroon po silang ng discount sa kanilang,

4724
04:43:29,820 --> 04:43:34,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: any transaction that they entered into by virtue of the compliance with the law.

4725
04:43:34,820 --> 04:43:36,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mrs. Speaker, Your Honors.

4726
04:43:36,820 --> 04:43:39,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Unfortunately, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor,

4727
04:43:39,820 --> 04:43:44,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pinapatungkol na po natin ito siguro sa Bureau of Internal Revenue,

4728
04:43:44,820 --> 04:43:49,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: meron pong mga nakarating na ulat sa amin na mga maliliit na nagninegosyo

4729
04:43:49,820 --> 04:43:54,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na hindi napapayagan ang claim nila para sa tax deductions.

4730
04:43:54,820 --> 04:43:57,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Naging isa nung usap-usapin yung pagkakaroon ng fake PWD ID.

4731
04:43:57,820 --> 04:44:09,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ngunit, para sa kinatawa na ito, hindi po dapat ipinapasa ang bigat ng pagtitiyak na lehitimo ang PWD IDs

4732
04:44:09,820 --> 04:44:17,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: o kung ano pang mga records na isinumite lang naman po sa kanila sa mga establishments, lalo na sa small businesses.

4733
04:44:17,820 --> 04:44:23,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes, may online verification system, pero hindi sa lahat ng pagkakataon na na-update ito.

4734
04:44:23,820 --> 04:44:28,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, final manifestation na lang na baka po pwedeng imbestigahan ito

4735
04:44:28,820 --> 04:44:36,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at makahingi na rin ng mga detalye ukol po dito kung meron naman pong nakapagsumite ng any grievance

4736
04:44:36,820 --> 04:44:44,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na katulad ng inihain ngayon dito sa floor na gusto natin hindi na po maulit, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

4737
04:44:44,400 --> 04:44:48,820
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of our distinguished colleague, the Honorable Co.

4738
04:44:48,820 --> 04:44:52,480
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Your time is up. Distinguished Sponsor, please respond briefly.

4739
04:44:52,480 --> 04:44:53,080
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yes. Yes.

4740
04:44:53,080 --> 04:44:59,840
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Aaksyonan po yan ng BIR at gusto po namin kung maaari magbigay po kayo sa

4741
04:44:59,840 --> 04:45:05,260
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ating kang galang-galang nakabataan party list representative ng listahan kung saan po itong mga negosyo,

4742
04:45:05,700 --> 04:45:10,760
