Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: being representative of all the cooperatives,

5805
05:28:44,460 --> 05:28:44,760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ito po,

5806
05:28:44,880 --> 05:28:46,420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ito yung sa mga kooperatiba po,

5807
05:28:46,540 --> 05:28:48,060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I have only a few questions.

5808
05:28:49,440 --> 05:28:50,800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ang una pong tanong,

5809
05:28:50,960 --> 05:28:52,900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ano ho ang primary reason

5810
05:28:52,900 --> 05:28:55,360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: bakit hirap na hirap makakuha

5811
05:28:55,360 --> 05:28:56,280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: o mag-renew,

5812
