Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Because in excess of 70 pesos, as you know, pwede ba natin silang tanggal yung excise tax?

5885
05:34:15,860 --> 05:34:17,740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, the government has to do it.

5886
05:34:17,860 --> 05:34:20,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: O kayo ba, kayo on your end, the DOF, o hindi nila kaya?

5887
