Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yeah.

5888
05:34:24,340 --> 05:34:24,520
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Oo.

5889
05:34:24,520 --> 05:34:25,560
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yun nga po.

5890
05:34:25,560 --> 05:34:28,720
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So, I think kung di ako nagkakamali, di ba,

5891
05:34:28,980 --> 05:34:29,880
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: na wala na yung ex...

5892
05:34:31,360 --> 05:34:31,600
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yeah.

5893
05:34:32,540 --> 05:34:32,780
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Yeah.

5894
05:34:33,220 --> 05:34:50,060
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: In fact, Mrs. Speaker, yung mga sinasabi po natin, this has been brought out earlier, yung mga VAT collection po natin on petroleum products, ito po yung pinaggagastusan natin doon sa identified na mga subsidies and assistance.

5895
05:34:50,060 --> 05:34:53,160
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Ito ang uplift program po ng gobyerno.

5896
