Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, ano ba ang pakakaiba ng POS sa special purpose machine na ginagamit nila?

5905
05:35:55,380 --> 05:36:17,180
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: ...

5906
05:36:17,180 --> 05:36:24,240
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Unang-una po, Mr. Speaker, itong mga betting machines required na po talaga sila na maiano nila, i-register po nila.

5907
05:36:24,640 --> 05:36:40,620
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So, ito po yung ni-raid po at kinolecta, ito po yung mga unregistered na mga betting machines at kung sila po ay makakapagrehistro, ibabalik naman po sa kanila ito ng ating Bureau of Internal Revenue, Mr. Speaker.

5908
05:36:40,720 --> 05:36:49,200
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: It is a small cockpit operation kung saan meron pong mga betting equipment, machines na hindi po nila nare-register.

5909
05:36:49,360 --> 05:36:52,860
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Ina-impose lang po naman yung law enforcement side of the BIR.

5910
05:36:52,900 --> 05:36:54,580
