06:19:34,280 --> 06:19:36,200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: medical funeral, transportation,

6364
06:19:36,620 --> 06:19:39,000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: food, cash assistance, educational assistance,

6365
06:19:39,420 --> 06:19:40,860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: housing repair materials.

6366
06:19:43,160 --> 06:19:45,100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Parang ito na po yung buong trabaho

6367
06:19:45,100 --> 06:19:46,080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng national government.

6368
06:19:46,080 --> 06:19:48,200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Parang lahat ng departamento

6369
06:19:48,200 --> 06:19:49,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ay nasasakot na.

6370
06:19:49,340 --> 06:19:51,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nang palgo.

6371
06:19:51,500 --> 06:19:52,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tama po ba?

6372
06:19:53,500 --> 06:19:55,000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Siguro confidential funds

6373
06:19:55,000 --> 06:19:57,240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: at intelligence funds na lang wala dito.

6374
06:19:58,180 --> 06:19:58,780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

6375
06:19:59,140 --> 06:19:59,920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: distinguished colleague,

6376
06:20:00,140 --> 06:20:01,740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ang dahilan po kung bakit magandito

6377
06:20:01,740 --> 06:20:05,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sapagkat bagamat meron po tayong mga

6378
06:20:05,040 --> 06:20:07,720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: nakapondo sa ilalim po

6379
06:20:07,720 --> 06:20:09,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng mga national government agencies

6380
06:20:09,680 --> 06:20:11,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po sa mga nabanggit

6381
06:20:11,680 --> 06:20:13,540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng mga klase ng mga proyekto,

6382
06:20:13,860 --> 06:20:15,100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: may mga pagkakataon po kasi

6383
06:20:15,100 --> 06:20:16,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na kinukulang pa rin po

6384
06:20:16,680 --> 06:20:19,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung mga umaabot sa mga local government.

6385
06:20:19,040 --> 06:20:22,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Doon po pumapasok yung FALGU,

6386
06:20:22,340 --> 06:20:23,340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung Financial Assistance

6387
06:20:23,340 --> 06:20:24,600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa Local Government Units,

6388
06:20:24,680 --> 06:20:25,860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung Growth Equity Fund,

6389
06:20:26,260 --> 06:20:28,480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung Support to Barangay Development,

6390
06:20:28,740 --> 06:20:30,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: at yung iba't-ibang klase pa po

6391
06:20:30,160 --> 06:20:31,920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng Local Government Support Fund

6392
06:20:31,920 --> 06:20:33,100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po ma-augment

6393
06:20:33,100 --> 06:20:35,300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung kung ano man po yung hindi pa

6394
06:20:35,300 --> 06:20:37,080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kayang i-cover

6395
06:20:37,080 --> 06:20:39,180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: noong mga national government agencies.

6396
06:20:39,440 --> 06:20:41,460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung ganyan po ang ating katwiran,

6397
06:20:41,560 --> 06:20:42,140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker,

6398
06:20:42,840 --> 06:20:44,360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: bakit yung mayayamang LGU

6399
06:20:44,360 --> 06:20:45,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung nakikinabang?

6400
06:20:45,880 --> 06:20:47,520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Di ba support to LGU?

6401
06:20:47,520 --> 06:20:48,960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Bakit nasusuportahan?

6402
06:20:49,040 --> 06:20:51,320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung mayayaman na halos hindi na kailangan ng tulong

6403
06:20:51,320 --> 06:20:54,320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: at hindi nasusuportahan yung mga pinakamahirap,

6404
06:20:54,840 --> 06:20:56,120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yan po ang data.

6405
06:20:56,860 --> 06:20:58,980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi naman mapapasilungalingan ang data.

6406
06:21:04,880 --> 06:21:07,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

6407
06:21:07,760 --> 06:21:10,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: opo, sumasang-ayon po ako sa punto

6408
06:21:10,040 --> 06:21:12,360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng ating Distinguished Colleague

6409
06:21:12,360 --> 06:21:14,600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na in theory po,

6410
06:21:14,820 --> 06:21:17,900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: dapat yung mga malalaking mga syudad,

6411
06:21:17,900 --> 06:21:20,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: dapat yung mga highly-urbanized cities

6412
06:21:20,120 --> 06:21:21,360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay may sapat na pondo

6413
06:21:21,360 --> 06:21:23,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po i-sustain yung mga pangangailangan

6414
06:21:23,620 --> 06:21:26,960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng kanilang sariling lokalidad.

6415
06:21:27,660 --> 06:21:28,420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: However po,

6416
06:21:29,020 --> 06:21:30,820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: may mga pagkakataon din po

6417
06:21:30,820 --> 06:21:32,880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na kinukulang pa rin po.

6418
06:21:33,520 --> 06:21:34,400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Halimbawa po,

6419
06:21:34,640 --> 06:21:36,280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kung maaari ko pong banggitin,

6420
06:21:36,420 --> 06:21:37,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

6421
06:21:37,220 --> 06:21:39,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: hindi po may pagkakataon.

6422
06:21:39,480 --> 06:21:41,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa lahat ng pagkakataon,

6423
06:21:41,440 --> 06:21:45,900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: priority yung mga mayayamang LGUs.

6424
06:21:45,900 --> 06:21:47,620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yan po yung data eh.

6425
06:21:47,900 --> 06:21:49,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung pinakamayayaman,

6426
06:21:49,440 --> 06:21:50,320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yun ang pinakamalalaki.

6427
06:21:51,100 --> 06:21:52,760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

6428
06:21:52,820 --> 06:21:54,820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung ipinakita pong datos kanina

6429
06:21:54,820 --> 06:21:57,080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay patungkol po sa FALGO,

6430
06:21:57,300 --> 06:21:58,280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung Financial Assistance

6431
06:21:58,280 --> 06:21:59,660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to Local Government Units.

6432
06:22:00,000 --> 06:22:02,020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kalahati po noong pondo

6433
06:22:02,020 --> 06:22:04,380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na nai-release sa ilalim ng FALGO

6434
06:22:04,380 --> 06:22:08,260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay related po doon sa tinatawag natin

6435
06:22:08,260 --> 06:22:10,140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na rice distribution.

6436
06:22:10,480 --> 06:22:11,740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yan po yung 2026.

6437
06:22:11,900 --> 06:22:13,520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero sa 2025 po,

6438
06:22:14,460 --> 06:22:15,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ganun din po.

6439
06:22:15,240 --> 06:22:16,240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung pinakamayayaman,

6440
06:22:16,860 --> 06:22:17,880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yun, yung nabigyan.

6441
06:22:17,900 --> 06:22:22,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Apo, we will check po,

6442
06:22:22,180 --> 06:22:24,100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: but we recognize the point po,

6443
06:22:24,240 --> 06:22:24,980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

6444
06:22:25,440 --> 06:22:26,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Distinguished Colleague,

6445
06:22:26,520 --> 06:22:27,540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ang nangyari lang po kasi

6446
06:22:27,540 --> 06:22:30,100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: noong 2026,

6447
06:22:30,240 --> 06:22:31,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: malinaw po yun,

6448
06:22:31,400 --> 06:22:33,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: population-based po kasi yung release

6449
06:22:33,240 --> 06:22:33,960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: noong rice,

6450
06:22:34,220 --> 06:22:35,260
