Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, yung kawalan ng listahan dito sa GEF hindi lang po sa 2026, tama po ba? Simula po magsimula itong fund na ito, lahat nung mga proyekto ay post-GAA na po, post-enactment na na isasama o na-identify at nabibigyan ng pondo.

8117
07:48:01,360 --> 07:48:44,990
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague. Yes po, kasi po meron pong, in theory po, every time we pass the GAA, there is already a qualified list of municipalities, cities and provinces po that qualify for the Growth Equity Fund, which is the master list essentially of all the LGUs that are considered as fourth and fifth class municipalities. But as to the amounts po, halimbawa kung magkano yung matatanggap ng bawat isa sa mga LGUs, tama po yun, wala po yun sa level ng GAA. That is determined po after the GAA is already passed.

8118
07:48:45,660 --> 07:48:59,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, bakit po sa kabila ng pagkakaroon na ng master list, halimbawa nung target po natin na matulungan ng mga LGUs na mga fourth at fifth class municipalities, may listahan na ito. At hindi po ba nakadepende din ang tulong na ibibigay

8119
07:48:59,980 --> 07:49:27,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng Growth Equity Fund sa devolution transition plan ng ating mga municipalities? Ibig sabihin meron na pong agarang batayan ang ating mga ahensya kung paano tiyak na maa-identify ang mga LGU, kung magkano at anong proyekto ang ilalagak sa ating GAA, pero bakit hindi po ba ito ginagawa? Madam Speaker, distinguished sponsor. Sorry.

8120
07:49:40,270 --> 07:49:45,340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, upon conferring with DBM,

8121
07:49:46,140 --> 07:49:53,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa level po ng NEP, kapag sinumite po nila sa atin ng ehekutibo yung NEP,

8122
07:49:53,440 --> 07:49:56,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: meron na po siyang kaakibat na listahan.

8123
07:49:56,240 --> 07:50:00,080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron sa kanila, hindi po ina-attach doon sa mismong NEP,

8124
07:50:00,440 --> 07:50:07,140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pero meron po silang listahan na siyang basihan po noong pong amount na kanila pong tinatalaga

8125
07:50:07,140 --> 07:50:09,200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po sa growth equity fund sa NEP.

8126
07:50:09,820 --> 07:50:13,540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: However, that's actually not an attachment to the NEP,

8127
07:50:13,900 --> 07:50:22,300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: but it is possible, it is technically possible to have such a list attached to the NEP and later on the GAA.

8128
07:50:22,300 --> 07:50:25,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker,

8129
07:50:25,620 --> 07:50:28,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May nasa 10 bilyon na pondo para dito para sa susunod na taon.

8130
07:50:29,000 --> 07:50:38,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin, tulad ng nasabing nyo, meron ng handang listahan na may mga proyekto at amount ng pondo para sa mga LGUs na ito.

8131
07:50:38,940 --> 07:50:39,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tama po ba?

8132
07:50:55,620 --> 07:51:11,080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ...

8133
07:51:11,080 --> 07:51:13,280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

8134
07:51:14,120 --> 07:51:22,700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pinapakita po sa akin ng DBM ngayon na meron na pong sa bawat klase ng local government unit

8135
07:51:22,700 --> 07:51:25,540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na pupapasok po.

8136
07:51:25,620 --> 07:51:32,540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Doon sa klasifikasyon ng 4th and 5th class municipality, meron na pong determined level ng allocation.

8137
07:51:33,080 --> 07:51:35,940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Halimbawa po, magbibigay lang po ako ng example,

8138
07:51:37,340 --> 07:51:45,380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: isa lang po yung probinsya sa buong bansa sa labas ng BARM na considered po na 4th and 5th class or 5th class which is Batanes.

8139
07:51:45,880 --> 07:51:50,480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron na pong identified amount dito na 51.5 million pesos.

8140
07:51:51,140 --> 07:51:55,480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa cities po, halimbawa may siyam na fourth and fifth class cities.

8141
07:51:55,620 --> 07:52:01,200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron po silang total allocation of 463.5 million.

8142
07:52:01,440 --> 07:52:07,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So meron pong designated amount per LGU.

8143
07:52:07,680 --> 07:52:15,300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero as for the projects that will be funded under the growth equity fund,

8144
07:52:15,680 --> 07:52:19,220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it still depends po on what the LGUs will request.

8145
07:52:19,220 --> 07:52:23,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But there are guidelines that govern.

8146
07:52:23,660 --> 07:52:25,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The types of projects.

8147
07:52:25,620 --> 07:52:26,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That can be released to them.

8148
07:52:27,040 --> 07:52:32,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron pong menu noong mga items na pwede po nilang i-request sa ilalim po ng growth equity fund.

8149
07:52:33,240 --> 07:52:35,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Speaker.

8150
07:52:35,600 --> 07:52:40,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na daw clear identification noong mga LGUs na makakatanggap.

8151
07:52:40,340 --> 07:52:50,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang sinasabi kaya nananatiling lump sum ay hindi pa identified kung ano yung kailangan ng barangay o municipality na mag-request.

8152
07:52:51,100 --> 07:52:54,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sinabi rin ang ating distinguished sponsor na meron namang guidelines.

8153
07:52:54,540 --> 07:52:55,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit nababalik.

8154
07:52:55,620 --> 07:53:03,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabahala po tayo dahil laging ang guidelines na nilalabas ay pagkatapos na ng enactment ng GAA.

8155
07:53:03,040 --> 07:53:09,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yan po ay nangyari ng 2022, 2023, 2025, 2026.

8156
07:53:09,860 --> 07:53:24,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At maski po ngayong 2027, nakalagay po dito na ang release po ng funds ay magiging subject pa sa guidelines na i-issue po ng DBM in coordination sa DILG, DOF, DEPDev,

8157
07:53:24,340 --> 07:53:26,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at iba pang mga relevant agencies.

8158
07:53:27,960 --> 07:53:38,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ba kapag ganito ang sistema Madam Speaker, mas lumalawak po yung espasyo ng maari itong prone sa misuse, abuse,

8159
07:53:38,940 --> 07:53:47,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung lump sum na nga, discretionary pabatay dun sa ilalabas na menu na may guidelines na hanggang ngayon hindi pa rin natin nakikita.

8160
07:53:49,100 --> 07:53:53,340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, I agree po with the Honorable Elago.

8161
07:53:53,340 --> 07:54:07,760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, sa kasalukuyan po kasi yung special provision ngayon, ang nakalagay po, release of funds for the growth equity fund shall be subject to the guidelines to be issued by DBM in coordination with DILG, DOF, DEPDev, and other relevant agencies.

8162
07:54:07,940 --> 07:54:10,880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yun lang po yung kasalukuyan na nakalagay sa GAA.

8163
07:54:11,740 --> 07:54:17,760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero siguro po similar to my response po to the Honorable EG Erice,

8164
07:54:18,300 --> 07:54:21,760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If we so wish po.

8165
07:54:23,340 --> 07:54:29,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Bukas naman po yung DBM na pwede po natin i-refine yung special provision further.

8166
07:54:30,380 --> 07:54:37,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Bukas po sila na ilagay na po natin dito kung ano po yung mga panuntunan na gusto po natin na idagdag.

8167
07:54:37,860 --> 07:54:47,320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: O yung isa pa pong kanina, yung suhesyon po na talakay po natin kasama po si Honorable Erice,

8168
07:54:47,320 --> 07:54:51,780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay pwedeng kapag na-develop po ng guidelines patungkol dito,

8169
07:54:51,780 --> 07:54:55,780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kailangan pong kunin yung approval ng Kongreso.

8170
07:54:55,780 --> 07:55:09,480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, again, the DBM is open to any refinements to the special provision for us to, I guess, have more clear say on the part of Congress

8171
07:55:09,480 --> 07:55:13,280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kung ano po yung mga panuntunan na kailangan sundan para po sa growth equity fund.

8172
07:55:14,460 --> 07:55:20,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, malinaw po, meron namang malinaw na pagbatayan para hindi maging lump sum ang growth equity fund.

8173
07:55:20,540 --> 07:55:20,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayan.

8174
07:55:20,820 --> 07:55:31,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya dapat itemized yan, dapat meron nang guidelines bago pa man maipasa itong GAA. Meron na dapat ngayong malinaw na pamantayan kung paano ito gagamitin.

8175
07:55:31,120 --> 07:55:37,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At higit sa lahat po, kinakailangan natin mapanagot kung merong may abuso sa paggamit nito.

8176
07:55:37,500 --> 07:55:43,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil kung hindi po natin yan gagawin, mananatilin pong isang malinaw na pork fund, ang growth equity fund.

8177
07:55:43,860 --> 07:55:50,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung walang malinaw na pamantayan kung paano ito tiyak na mapupunta sa servisyo na kailangan.

8178
07:55:50,820 --> 07:55:51,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng tao.

8179
07:55:51,520 --> 07:55:54,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

8180
07:55:55,040 --> 07:56:01,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Manghihingi na lang po tayo ng ulat tungkol dun sa responsibility and accountability guidelines ng growth equity fund.

8181
07:56:01,480 --> 07:56:02,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

8182
07:56:03,060 --> 07:56:06,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, we will comply po. We will share the same to the Honorable Elago.

8183
07:56:07,040 --> 07:56:08,360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po.

8184
07:56:09,140 --> 07:56:09,700
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

8185
07:56:11,280 --> 07:56:20,160
Rep. Beverley Rose A. Dimacuha: Madam Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move to recognize Representative Attorney Renee Louise Co of Kabataan Partylist.

8186
07:56:20,820 --> 07:56:24,900
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Renee Louise Co of Kabataan Partylist is hereby recognized for her interpellation.

8187
07:56:26,560 --> 07:56:30,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Magandang gabi po, Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat po.

8188
07:56:30,760 --> 07:56:33,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And magandang gabi rin po to the Distinguished Sponsor.

8189
07:56:34,480 --> 07:56:46,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tatanong din po tayo ang mga natanong na rin po natin sa ibang mga ahensya but we still felt it appropriate to ask for the lump sum funds dahil po classified under LGSF

8190
07:56:47,520 --> 07:56:50,800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang support to the Barangay Development Program of the NTF-ELCAC.

8191
07:56:50,820 --> 07:57:12,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa pagbaybay lang po ng kasaysayan ng Barangay Development Program of the NTF-ELCAC, nagsimula po ito ng GAA 2021 at nagpapatuloy nitong 2027 at tinignan po natin yung mga allotments na kada taon nag-iiba.

8192
07:57:13,080 --> 07:57:19,760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pansin po natin na yung budget it also varies pero nag-vary din yung numbers ng mga barangay.

8193
07:57:20,820 --> 07:57:28,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang recipient nito from 822 ng 2021 to ngayong GAA 2027, 1,948.

8194
07:57:28,860 --> 07:57:41,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Wala pong isang taon na pare-pareho yung number ng mga barangays na purportedly cleared and therefore ay maaaring makakuha ng support sa BDP.

8195
07:57:43,140 --> 07:57:48,980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At iba-iba rin po yung allotments. 2021, 20 million each for the 822 barangays.

8196
07:57:49,740 --> 07:57:50,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2022,

8197
07:57:50,820 --> 07:57:54,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 4 million each for the 1,406 barangays.

8198
07:57:55,000 --> 07:57:55,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2023,

8199
07:57:56,320 --> 07:58:00,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 6.6 million each for 959 barangays.

8200
07:58:01,160 --> 07:58:01,520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2024,

8201
07:58:01,900 --> 07:58:05,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2.5 million each for 864 barangays.

8202
07:58:05,200 --> 07:58:05,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2025,

8203
07:58:05,860 --> 07:58:08,960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2.5 million each for 780 barangays.

8204
07:58:09,580 --> 07:58:10,280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2026,

8205
07:58:10,500 --> 07:58:12,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 10 million each for 808 barangays.

8206
07:58:13,020 --> 07:58:13,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And ngayon po,

8207
07:58:13,680 --> 07:58:17,020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 5 million each for 1,948 barangays.

8208
07:58:17,640 --> 07:58:18,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker,

8209
07:58:18,260 --> 07:58:19,100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Good Sponsor,

8210
07:58:19,740 --> 07:58:20,800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi pa rin po

8211
07:58:20,800 --> 07:58:29,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nasasagot sa amin yung tanong na what constitutes cleared barangays under the Barangay Development Program.

8212
07:58:29,940 --> 07:58:45,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron po sa ating binigay na essentially paraan paano ikaklassify at gagawin po ng DILG at ico-collate ng DBM yung ganitong listahan in a year.

8213
07:58:45,780 --> 07:58:49,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But we'd like to pursue that line of question, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

8214
07:58:49,600 --> 07:58:49,720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you.

8215
07:58:50,800 --> 07:58:59,520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Natatrack po ba ng DBM sa budget books kung aling mga barangay ang naging beneficiary ng BDP sa mga nagdaang taon?

8216
07:59:00,020 --> 07:59:15,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Natatrack po ba niya, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, if one barangay has been cleared for all years, may ilang barangay ba na hindi maki-clear in a particular year, mawawala sa listahan, may bago, etc.?

8217
07:59:15,600 --> 07:59:19,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, ano po bang tracking na ginawa ng DBM dito?

8218
07:59:20,800 --> 07:59:32,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, yung determination po patungkol sa ano yung cleared barangay, nagmumula po yan sa NTF-ELCAC.

8219
07:59:33,080 --> 07:59:38,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ang binibigay lang po sa DBM ay yung listahan na po ng mga cleared barangays.

8220
07:59:39,640 --> 07:59:48,640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung patungkol po dun sa beneficiary barangays, every year po, as you mentioned, for example, 2021, 822 barangays.

8221
07:59:48,640 --> 07:59:50,640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For 2022, 1,000.

8222
07:59:50,800 --> 07:59:54,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: 406 barangays, and so on and so forth po, until 2026.

8223
07:59:57,160 --> 07:59:59,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Isang beses lang po, pwedeng makatanggap.

8224
08:00:00,000 --> 08:00:06,640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng SBDP, yung LGSF SBDP, yung particular cleared barangay.

8225
08:00:06,880 --> 08:00:08,660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So they can only receive once po.

8226
08:00:09,220 --> 08:00:14,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Even though they're declared earlier as a cleared barangay or later,

8227
08:00:15,920 --> 08:00:21,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: nakadepende po sa kailan po isusumite ng NTF-ELCAC sa DBM

8228
08:00:21,800 --> 08:00:27,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po as a qualified barangay po for LGSF SBDP.

8229
08:00:27,160 --> 08:00:33,720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, is the sponsor confirming that this is a one-time grant?

8230
08:00:34,320 --> 08:00:40,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meaning kung nabigay na po ito ng isang taon, ay hindi na po ito mabibigay sa mga succeeding years?

8231
08:00:41,040 --> 08:00:42,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

8232
08:00:42,560 --> 08:00:44,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes po, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

8233
08:00:45,020 --> 08:00:47,380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: DBM confirms po that this is a one-time grant.

8234
08:00:47,780 --> 08:00:52,460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Once you've received it, you can no longer receive it in succeeding years.

8235
08:00:53,060 --> 08:00:57,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, hindi po ba unfair sa barangay?

8236
08:00:57,160 --> 08:01:02,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung barangays who've declared themselves cleared earlier, 20 million each ang nakuha.

8237
08:01:03,020 --> 08:01:09,080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo for example, in 2021, kumpara po sa mga ibang taon, for example, 2024, 2025,

8238
08:01:09,660 --> 08:01:12,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2.5 million pesos lang kada barangay yung nakuha.

8239
08:01:16,700 --> 08:01:20,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, yes, we agree with the point.

8240
08:01:20,480 --> 08:01:23,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The DBM agrees with the point of our Distinguished Colleague.

8241
08:01:24,300 --> 08:01:26,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung determination po kasi as to how much,

8242
08:01:26,840 --> 08:01:30,380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: how much each barangay would receive in a particular year

8243
08:01:30,380 --> 08:01:36,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: is dependent on the allocation that LGSF SBDP receives for a particular year.

8244
08:01:36,740 --> 08:01:44,760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because for a particular year, the number of beneficiary barangays is predetermined by NTF-ELCAC.

8245
08:01:44,960 --> 08:01:52,340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, halimbawa po, nagkataon na ang liit ng alokasyon ng SBDP sa taon na yun,

8246
08:01:52,340 --> 08:01:56,400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yun po, I agree po, nagkakataon po na,

8247
08:01:56,840 --> 08:01:58,140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: mababa talaga yung natatanggap nila.

8248
08:01:58,240 --> 08:02:04,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May pagkakataon din naman po na konti lang sila na cleared barangays na nag-qualify,

8249
08:02:04,800 --> 08:02:07,600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: tas malaki yung alokasyon, so mas malaki po yung natatanggap nila.

8250
08:02:07,740 --> 08:02:12,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, the DBM recognizes po the point of our Distinguished Colleague na

8251
08:02:12,680 --> 08:02:17,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because of the formula and the determination,

8252
08:02:18,680 --> 08:02:22,180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: nagkakataon nga po talaga that some years are higher than others.

8253
08:02:22,800 --> 08:02:24,440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

8254
08:02:24,960 --> 08:02:26,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: since na-mention na one time,

8255
08:02:26,840 --> 08:02:35,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: masasabi po ba ng DBM with definitiveness na wala pong isang barangay na duplicate

8256
08:02:35,220 --> 08:02:43,280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nakakuha ng multiple times para po sa barangay development program?

8257
08:03:05,810 --> 08:03:07,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

8258
08:03:07,780 --> 08:03:11,080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kami po ni Sec Kim dito sa likod, tinatanong po namin yung team,

8259
08:03:11,380 --> 08:03:17,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: are you absolutely sure that there's no barangay that received the SBDP twice?

8260
08:03:18,500 --> 08:03:24,380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And they confirm po, as far as they know po, there's no barangay po that has received it twice.

8261
08:03:24,820 --> 08:03:26,820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's also data in Compass po,

8262
08:03:26,840 --> 08:03:31,060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the DBM website that we can use to verify that information.

8263
08:03:31,660 --> 08:03:38,280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Does DBM check that po yearly na kung anumang listahang binibigay ng DILG

8264
08:03:38,280 --> 08:03:44,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or ang iba't ibang ahensya ay hindi po nakakuha na noon pa?

8265
08:04:11,340 --> 08:04:12,660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

8266
08:04:12,660 --> 08:04:16,580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sorry, we're just probing also, making sure that the answer is correct.

8267
08:04:35,010 --> 08:04:36,060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

8268
08:04:38,560 --> 08:04:44,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the DBM relies greatly on the list,

8269
08:04:44,900 --> 08:04:51,580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the recommended barangays that is included in the list submitted by the NTF-ELCAC,

8270
08:04:51,580 --> 08:04:56,740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: but the DBM agrees that they should do a second check,

8271
08:04:56,840 --> 08:05:00,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: just to make sure that there are no duplicate barangays po.

8272
08:05:02,060 --> 08:05:06,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang separate check na po ba ito, gagawin po ba ngayon,

8273
08:05:06,340 --> 08:05:10,280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or pwede po bang magsumite na lang po ang report ng DBM?

8274
08:05:19,000 --> 08:05:23,220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker, so they rely on the attestation,

8275
08:05:23,220 --> 08:05:26,220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: so there's a certification that NTF-ELCAC,

8276
08:05:26,840 --> 08:05:31,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: specifically issues to certify that there are no duplicate barangays,

8277
08:05:31,540 --> 08:05:35,580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: but the DBM commits po that from here on out, moving forward,

8278
08:05:35,980 --> 08:05:38,640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: they will do a second check po for duplicates.

8279
08:05:39,480 --> 08:05:42,800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, ito rin po yung line of questioning natin,

8280
08:05:42,880 --> 08:05:45,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I think, noong nagtanong tayo sa general principles,

8281
08:05:46,260 --> 08:05:48,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: aside from barangay development program,

8282
08:05:48,180 --> 08:05:53,660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kahit po yung challenge natin sa DBM for confidential and intelligence funds,

8283
08:05:54,060 --> 08:05:56,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano po ba ine-exercise ng DBM?

8284
08:05:56,840 --> 08:06:03,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung mandato nila na hindi lang sana collator ng mga budget requests

8285
08:06:03,460 --> 08:06:07,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and i-compile for a NEP,

8286
08:06:08,240 --> 08:06:12,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero ano po bang paraan na ginagawa nila to ensure na

8287
08:06:12,460 --> 08:06:17,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung mga binubukas ng mga ibat-ibang ahensya at that level pa lang

8288
08:06:17,560 --> 08:06:25,060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: before po isubmit yung request for the budget at maaprubahan

8289
08:06:25,060 --> 08:06:26,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at ma-spot maybe ng COA,

8290
08:06:26,820 --> 08:06:30,380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, two years down the line, kung mayroon pong pagkakamali,

8291
08:06:30,780 --> 08:06:33,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may opportunity ang DBM kung paano po siya,

8292
08:06:33,580 --> 08:06:39,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi lang i-double check, pero tignan kung mayroon pong kailangan i-improve or hindi.

8293
08:06:39,760 --> 08:06:41,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nonetheless, Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

8294
08:06:42,900 --> 08:06:48,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung mayroon pong maiprovide yung DBM na kopya ng attestation

8295
08:06:48,460 --> 08:06:52,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para makita po natin kung ano pong mga checks yung ginagawa

8296
08:06:52,120 --> 08:06:55,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng hindi lang ng DBM pero ng NTF-ELCAC and DILG,

8297
08:06:56,820 --> 08:07:04,300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para makita kung ano yung mga proseso nila sa paglatag,

8298
08:07:04,400 --> 08:07:06,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: anong mga baranggay, yung cleared or hindi.

8299
08:07:06,340 --> 08:07:09,080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero dahil Madam Speaker, as I mentioned nga po earlier,

8300
08:07:09,220 --> 08:07:11,740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung isang point na po na, well, one, unfair.

8301
08:07:12,800 --> 08:07:19,240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: How can we say na each baranggay makukuha nila yung kailangan nila

8302
08:07:19,240 --> 08:07:25,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: o yung dapat na makuha nila kung each year mukhang dependent sa allocation?

8303
08:07:26,820 --> 08:07:27,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung makukuha o hindi.

8304
08:07:28,200 --> 08:07:31,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 20 million for this year, 2.5 million the next.

8305
08:07:32,860 --> 08:07:36,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: What's to say na ito talaga yung parang solusyon na kailangan nila?

8306
08:07:37,400 --> 08:07:41,500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And dahil, secondly, Madam Speaker, and this is our standing critique of the program,

8307
08:07:42,020 --> 08:07:47,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nasa budget naman po ng mga iba't-ibang ahensya na may specific mandate

8308
08:07:47,460 --> 08:07:54,520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to provide these services na pwedeng dun po ilagay yung pangailangan

8309
08:07:54,520 --> 08:07:56,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga local government units natin.

8310
08:07:56,820 --> 08:08:01,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Rather than through this program na standing pa rin,

8311
08:08:01,800 --> 08:08:05,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung pinupoint out natin na quote-unquote conditional development po

8312
08:08:05,820 --> 08:08:10,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang inooffer ng barangay development program ng NTF-ELCAC.

8313
08:08:10,220 --> 08:08:18,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And third point, kung this conditional development comes at the cost of the suppression of rights

8314
08:08:18,860 --> 08:08:22,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and freedoms of the people, dahil ang report sa atin on ground,

8315
08:08:22,780 --> 08:08:26,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano ba nag-clear yung isang baranggay, tatanong-tanongin,

8316
08:08:26,800 --> 08:08:33,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung ang student leader sa isang campus ay affiliated ka daw ba sa leftist groups?

8317
08:08:33,400 --> 08:08:36,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can you sign this memo to say hindi? Etc.

8318
08:08:37,480 --> 08:08:43,740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Surveillance, harassment, lahat po ito ay begging the question na

8319
08:08:43,740 --> 08:08:46,940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is this the best way for development?

8320
08:08:47,680 --> 08:08:52,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Or is it, you know, proper funding of the different projects

8321
08:08:52,700 --> 08:08:56,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to the appropriate line items to the different agencies?

8322
08:08:56,800 --> 08:09:01,060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, hindi po ito ang tunay na pagpapaunlad.

8323
08:09:01,540 --> 08:09:06,320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi nito natutugunan ang sinasabi ng layunin na wakasan ng armadong tunggalian

8324
08:09:06,320 --> 08:09:08,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nangyayari sa bansa natin ngayon.

8325
08:09:08,180 --> 08:09:14,280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa halip na ilagay ang programang malabo ang proseso at pamantayang para magpa-clear

8326
08:09:14,280 --> 08:09:19,200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at meron nga pong maaaring mangyari na may tunggalian pa sa mga baranggay

8327
08:09:19,200 --> 08:09:21,080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil hindi po pantay yung nakukuha nila,

8328
08:09:21,640 --> 08:09:25,420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mas mabuti pang ilagay na lang ang pondo sa direktang mga serbisyong panlipunan.

8329
08:09:25,880 --> 08:09:26,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: That's all, Madam Speaker.

8330
08:09:26,800 --> 08:09:30,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, we look forward to receiving the report

8331
08:09:30,860 --> 08:09:41,960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: on how DILG and NTF-ELCAC attests na hindi po duplicates and whatever else methods

8332
08:09:41,960 --> 08:09:46,800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to ensure na hindi naman nauulit yung mga baranggay

8333
08:09:46,800 --> 08:09:50,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: as per the rules and regulations of this program.

8334
08:09:51,060 --> 08:09:53,920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But for now, I have no further questions.

8335
08:09:54,360 --> 08:09:55,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you very much to the sponsor

8336
08:09:56,800 --> 08:10:00,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for answering our questions and I yield my time to the floor.

8337
08:10:00,920 --> 08:10:01,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker.

8338
08:10:01,900 --> 08:10:03,360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker.

8339
08:10:03,520 --> 08:10:05,340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much to the Honorable Renee Co.

