8344
08:10:20,860 --> 08:10:22,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

8345
08:10:23,380 --> 08:10:24,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa sponsor,

8346
08:10:24,260 --> 08:10:30,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bibilisan na lang po natin ang interpellation.

8347
08:10:31,420 --> 08:10:32,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Less than 30 minutes na po.

8348
