Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, unang topic po natin ay yung pa ring Local Government Support Fund

8351
08:10:42,380 --> 08:10:44,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dahil nasa lump sum funds po tayo.

8352
08:10:45,000 --> 08:10:46,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron po tayong presentation.

8353
08:10:47,700 --> 08:10:49,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Again, yan.

8354
08:10:50,100 --> 08:10:50,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

8355
08:10:50,380 --> 08:10:54,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nakikita po natin, again, one decade plus the proposal.

8356
08:10:54,260 --> 08:10:55,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For 2027.

8357
08:10:56,580 --> 08:11:00,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, hindi ito unang pagkakataon na tumaas ang LGSF.

8358
08:11:00,660 --> 08:11:02,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, you can see in 2018,

8359
08:11:03,260 --> 08:11:06,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay 51 billion ang inabot nito.

8360
08:11:09,020 --> 08:11:13,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As proposed, pero actually, ang appropriated, the orange one,

8361
08:11:14,060 --> 08:11:16,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the highest was in 2021.

8362
08:11:17,160 --> 08:11:19,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sorry, 2017 pala.

8363
08:11:20,280 --> 08:11:20,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2017.

8364
08:11:20,880 --> 08:11:21,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2017.

8365
08:11:21,300 --> 08:11:22,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Unang budget ni...

8366
08:11:24,260 --> 08:11:26,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pangulong Duterte, nung panahon niya.

8367
08:11:26,860 --> 08:11:29,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang pinakamataas nun ay 39 billion.

8368
08:11:30,140 --> 08:11:30,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

8369
08:11:30,460 --> 08:11:31,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Actual appropriations.

8370
08:11:33,140 --> 08:11:38,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero talaga, bakit ba naging mainit na topic ang LGF?

8371
08:11:38,680 --> 08:11:45,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil sa pagbukol nito, especially in the 2026 GAA.

8372
08:11:45,700 --> 08:11:46,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung kasalukuyang taon.

8373
08:11:47,680 --> 08:11:47,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

8374
08:11:47,820 --> 08:11:52,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil nakita natin, noong 2025, yung appropriated, yung orange,

8375
08:11:54,260 --> 08:11:58,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 22.99 billion ang LGSF.

8376
08:11:58,720 --> 08:12:03,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero sa 2026 budget, naging 57.8 billion.

8377
08:12:04,500 --> 08:12:04,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

8378
08:12:05,080 --> 08:12:08,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, almost times 3 ang inilaki.

8379
08:12:09,860 --> 08:12:10,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

8380
08:12:10,120 --> 08:12:12,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya po, controversial ngayon.

8381
08:12:12,240 --> 08:12:14,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Even at the time, Madam Speaker,

8382
08:12:15,720 --> 08:12:17,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: anong ginawa ito sa BICAM?

8383
08:12:17,720 --> 08:12:18,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: BICAM po nangyari ito.

8384
08:12:19,800 --> 08:12:19,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

8385
08:12:19,940 --> 08:12:22,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sinabi na po ng kinatawang ito,

8386
08:12:22,620 --> 08:12:27,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: presidential LGU pork yan.

8387
08:12:27,480 --> 08:12:28,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun ang tinawag natin dyan.

8388
08:12:28,820 --> 08:12:30,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: LGU pork ng presidente.

8389
08:12:31,540 --> 08:12:31,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

8390
08:12:32,120 --> 08:12:36,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At, mamaya, ipapoint out din natin,

8391
08:12:37,100 --> 08:12:40,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: saan ang galing yung pondo na nilagay dyan.

8392
08:12:40,740 --> 08:12:41,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero yun ang point.

8393
08:12:41,740 --> 08:12:45,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pinapakita lang natin kung bakit mainit na topic ngayon ang LGSF.

8394
08:12:45,940 --> 08:12:46,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next slide na po.

8395
08:12:50,000 --> 08:12:51,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, pinapakita lang yung mga components

8396
08:12:51,800 --> 08:12:53,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nung LGSF.

8397
08:12:54,700 --> 08:12:55,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Iba-iba nga.

8398
08:12:55,940 --> 08:12:57,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nabanggit kanina, Growth Equity Fund.

8399
08:12:58,540 --> 08:13:00,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kanina lang, tinatanong yung tungkol sa

8400
08:13:00,660 --> 08:13:03,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Barangay Development Program.

8401
08:13:05,080 --> 08:13:07,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ang pinakamalaking component yan,

8402
08:13:07,800 --> 08:13:08,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: single biggest component,

8403
08:13:09,120 --> 08:13:11,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: is yung tinatawag na financial assistance

8404
08:13:11,120 --> 08:13:12,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to local government units.

8405
08:13:13,060 --> 08:13:14,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At yun yung talagang lumaki.

8406
08:13:14,780 --> 08:13:18,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, it's 37.49 billion.

8407
08:13:19,040 --> 08:13:19,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

8408
08:13:20,240 --> 08:13:21,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next slide.

8409
08:13:21,800 --> 08:13:24,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito lang.

8410
08:13:24,340 --> 08:13:27,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pinapakita lang kung gaano yung naging paglaki

8411
08:13:27,160 --> 08:13:29,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng financial assistance to local government units.

8412
08:13:30,520 --> 08:13:31,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, as I said,

8413
08:13:32,000 --> 08:13:35,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: bumukol talaga nung,

8414
08:13:36,760 --> 08:13:37,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: well, lumaki na.

8415
08:13:37,840 --> 08:13:38,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Actually, papalaki na

8416
08:13:38,700 --> 08:13:42,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: during the Marcos Junior Administration.

8417
08:13:43,340 --> 08:13:44,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As you can see,

8418
08:13:44,940 --> 08:13:46,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: may pataas na trajectory.

8419
08:13:47,300 --> 08:13:51,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2025, it was already at 18.9 billion.

8420
08:13:51,800 --> 08:13:54,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But 2026, talagang

8421
08:13:54,520 --> 08:14:00,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nag-skyrocket to 37.4 billion.

8422
08:14:00,380 --> 08:14:01,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And also note,

8423
08:14:01,960 --> 08:14:04,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na lumalaki yung orange bar.

8424
08:14:04,340 --> 08:14:05,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig sabihin nun,

8425
08:14:05,160 --> 08:14:06,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kongreso ang nagdadagdag.

8426
08:14:06,820 --> 08:14:07,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi yan NEP.

8427
08:14:08,240 --> 08:14:10,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, congressional intervention,

8428
08:14:10,760 --> 08:14:12,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: insertion, whatever you may call it.

8429
08:14:14,000 --> 08:14:14,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

8430
08:14:15,540 --> 08:14:15,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now,

8431
08:14:16,560 --> 08:14:19,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kanina, pinakita po ng kasamahan natin

8432
08:14:19,080 --> 08:14:21,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung regional allocation.

8433
08:14:21,160 --> 08:14:21,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

8434
08:14:22,080 --> 08:14:24,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung regional and then hanggang mga city level.

8435
08:14:24,940 --> 08:14:26,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, hinighlight nga.

8436
08:14:26,920 --> 08:14:27,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bakit ganon?

8437
08:14:27,600 --> 08:14:28,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano ba ang kriteriya?

8438
08:14:28,980 --> 08:14:30,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sino nag-de-decide?

8439
08:14:30,740 --> 08:14:32,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At bakit tila mas malaki

8440
08:14:32,200 --> 08:14:33,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga mas mayamang syudad?

8441
08:14:34,020 --> 08:14:35,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mas malaki pa ang nakukuha?

8442
08:14:35,700 --> 08:14:37,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, ito naman, additional lang.

8443
08:14:38,360 --> 08:14:41,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ito, mas sa level ng individual projects.

8444
08:14:41,400 --> 08:14:43,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para ipakita lang natin sa napunta

8445
08:14:43,140 --> 08:14:47,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga, yung financial assistance.

8446
08:14:48,120 --> 08:14:50,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, these are the top five

8447
08:14:50,220 --> 08:14:51,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: biggest projects.

8448
08:14:51,160 --> 08:14:53,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Biggest single projects.

8449
08:14:54,780 --> 08:14:57,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Particularly, yung capital outlay projects

8450
08:14:57,380 --> 08:14:59,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na pinunduhan ng financial assistance.

8451
08:15:00,000 --> 08:15:00,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung FALGU.

8452
08:15:01,380 --> 08:15:01,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

8453
08:15:02,000 --> 08:15:05,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Noong 2025, single biggest project, 500 million.

8454
08:15:06,380 --> 08:15:10,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para nga yan sa multi-purpose building sa pamantasan ng lungsod ng Maynila.

8455
08:15:10,640 --> 08:15:11,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 500 million.

8456
08:15:12,600 --> 08:15:18,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Second biggest, yung 450 million na ito nasa balita na talaga.

8457
08:15:18,360 --> 08:15:24,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung para sa retrofitting and rehab ng Robredo Coliseum sa Naga City.

8458
08:15:25,740 --> 08:15:27,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Third, Guimaras Province.

8459
08:15:27,780 --> 08:15:33,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 200 million peso multi-purpose building, phase two.

8460
08:15:34,500 --> 08:15:39,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Fourth, nakita naman natin dyan, a farm-to-market road, 150 million.

8461
08:15:39,660 --> 08:15:41,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Malaking farm-to-market road ito.

8462
08:15:41,900 --> 08:15:45,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi usually, ang farm-to-market road, 10, 15 million lang.

8463
08:15:45,840 --> 08:15:52,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, Caloocan City, that's the fifth multi-purpose building para sa PNPBFP.

8464
08:15:53,780 --> 08:15:54,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 135 million.

8465
08:15:54,700 --> 08:15:55,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That's 2025.

8466
08:15:56,160 --> 08:15:57,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2026.

8467
08:15:57,780 --> 08:16:04,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para magka-idea din lang tayo, ang pinakamalaking infra-project, single, Batangas.

8468
08:16:05,100 --> 08:16:06,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Partikular sa Lipa.

8469
08:16:06,840 --> 08:16:11,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Multi-purpose building, phase one, 500 million pesos, single project.

8470
08:16:12,320 --> 08:16:15,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, tapos San Juan City, may dalawang San Juan City.

8471
08:16:15,000 --> 08:16:22,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: San Juan City, medical or hospital equipment, 356 million pesos.

8472
08:16:22,840 --> 08:16:27,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Quezon City, rehab of a road, 179 million.

8473
08:16:27,780 --> 08:16:37,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Laguna Province, purchase of 40 units ambulance, 143 million pesos.

8474
08:16:38,080 --> 08:16:38,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wow!

8475
08:16:39,460 --> 08:16:41,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Napawaw din yung isang kasama natin dito.

8476
08:16:42,480 --> 08:16:45,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil alam ko, lahat ng LGU.

8477
08:16:46,140 --> 08:16:46,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

8478
08:16:46,960 --> 08:16:47,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan ang gusto.

8479
08:16:48,300 --> 08:16:51,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then San Juan City, hospital buildings, 100 million.

8480
08:16:51,500 --> 08:16:55,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, just to give an idea kung ano yung posible at binibigay.

8481
08:16:57,000 --> 08:16:57,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Through

8482
08:16:57,780 --> 08:17:02,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung LGSF, particularly yung financial assistance.

8483
08:17:02,560 --> 08:17:08,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang mga tanong nga, siguro kahit nung mga kinatawan dito, buti sila.

8484
08:17:09,000 --> 08:17:09,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paano naman yung iba?

8485
08:17:10,160 --> 08:17:10,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paano naman kami?

8486
08:17:11,200 --> 08:17:12,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Who decides?

8487
08:17:12,960 --> 08:17:16,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun nga ang tanong.

8488
08:17:16,320 --> 08:17:17,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pwede po bang maipaliwanag?

8489
08:17:18,960 --> 08:17:25,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sino ang nagdi-decide kung sino ang mabibigyan, maaprubahan?

8490
08:17:25,620 --> 08:17:27,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ano yung criteria?

8491
08:17:27,780 --> 08:17:34,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Lalo pa dito sa mga infrastructure projects, parang wala yatang limit ito.

8492
08:17:35,760 --> 08:17:48,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi yung financial assistance, typically, for infrastructure, it's 5 million, 10 million, pero tila umaabot hanggang 500 million.

8493
08:17:49,200 --> 08:17:51,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, anong klaseng guidelines po ang nag-aalaw nito?

8494
08:17:51,980 --> 08:17:57,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, could the sponsor enlighten us on how the FALGU works?

8495
08:17:57,780 --> 08:17:58,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Who approves?

8496
08:17:59,720 --> 08:18:00,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At bakit?

8497
08:18:00,860 --> 08:18:01,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ganon.

8498
08:18:02,500 --> 08:18:26,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, so the DBM, what we state in the GAA is that the DBM will be the one to execute from the point of evaluating to the point of releasing of the LGSF based on the menu po na ating inilalagay doon po sa GAA.

8499
08:18:26,120 --> 08:18:26,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay.

8500
08:18:27,780 --> 08:18:33,960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, in regard to how they evaluate, they have a scorecard po that they use as a basis.

8501
08:18:34,400 --> 08:18:36,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That is their evaluation criteria.

8502
08:18:36,960 --> 08:18:53,320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tulad po ng nabanggit, ilan po sa mga tinitignan nila ay good financial housekeeping, functionality of the local development council, compliance with subay-bayan reporting requirements, financial accomplishment, physical accomplishment, and the like.

8503
08:18:53,920 --> 08:18:57,320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nakabase din po sila doon po sa request ng mga LGUs.

8504
08:18:57,780 --> 08:19:01,600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, yung iba po kasi LGU nag-request, yung iba naman po hindi din.

8505
08:19:01,800 --> 08:19:06,780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, limited din po sila by the types of requests na dumadating sa kanila.

8506
08:19:06,780 --> 08:19:27,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, all of the whole process po from the time of setting the criteria and getting the requests po through the portal of DBM, evaluating it and eventually releasing it, lahat po yan nasa loob po ng DBM.

8507
08:19:27,780 --> 08:19:29,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, una, emphasize ko lang.

8508
08:19:29,780 --> 08:19:34,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya po namin tinawag to, last year pa, this is presidential pork.

8509
08:19:34,620 --> 08:19:36,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi sabi natin, discretionary ultimately.

8510
08:19:37,420 --> 08:19:48,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Malaking lump sum, tapos ultimately, it's up to the executive, president, to decide kung sino ang magagawaran at magkano.

8511
08:19:49,340 --> 08:19:49,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Parang ganon.

8512
08:19:51,860 --> 08:19:56,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, ang nililinaw po rito, actually, ang patakaran.

8513
08:19:57,780 --> 08:20:07,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay DBM ang gumawa ng guidelines, DBM ang nag-evaluate ng mga applications or submissions, at DBM din ang nag-a-approve.

8514
08:20:09,140 --> 08:20:12,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Including kung magkano yung ibibigay. Tama po ba?

8515
08:20:12,720 --> 08:20:13,920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po, Madam Speaker.

8516
08:20:14,060 --> 08:20:21,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At tama rin po ba na under the guidelines of DBM, walang limit or cap, particularly doon sa capital outlay projects.

8517
08:20:21,980 --> 08:20:26,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya po nakakakita tayo ng 500 million na isang proyekto lang.

8518
08:20:27,100 --> 08:20:27,760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

8519
08:20:27,780 --> 08:20:29,060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, wala pong cap.

8520
08:20:29,300 --> 08:20:33,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala rin cap. So, theoretically, pwede. Kahit 1 billion, pwede.

8521
08:20:33,920 --> 08:20:34,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ganun nga.

8522
08:20:35,320 --> 08:20:39,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, hindi po ba, wala po tayong nakikitang concern doon.

8523
08:20:39,540 --> 08:20:49,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: From the point of view of kahit yung equity, katulad ng sinasabi kanina, napakaraming mga LGU na nangangailangan ng infrastructure.

8524
08:20:49,980 --> 08:20:53,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ano po tingin ng DBM? Guidelines nila yan eh.

8525
08:20:55,100 --> 08:20:57,020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

8526
08:20:57,780 --> 08:21:03,380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Upon conferring with the DBM, yes po, we agree with the point of our distinguished colleague.

8527
08:21:03,380 --> 08:21:13,380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: A cap is something that they can explore in the evaluation criteria in the guidelines that they will adopt for 2027.

8528
08:21:14,300 --> 08:21:21,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pwede po yan. Kasi tama naman po yung punto ng ating distinguished colleague na you have a limited fiscal space.

8529
08:21:21,620 --> 08:21:26,780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's only a finite amount that's allocated for FALGU.

8530
08:21:26,780 --> 08:21:27,580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tapos, biglang.

8531
08:21:27,780 --> 08:21:34,220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May malaking-malaki na isang request na makakain yung malaking porsyento noong kabuuan po.

8532
08:21:34,360 --> 08:21:41,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, the DBM agrees po that putting a cap is something that can be explored in the succeeding fiscal years po.

8533
08:21:41,760 --> 08:21:45,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, well, next point.

8534
08:21:47,040 --> 08:21:54,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang binabanggit po talaga ay ang tumatanggap ng request at nag-a-approve from the LGUs at nag-a-approve DBM daw.

8535
08:21:54,820 --> 08:21:57,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po ang papel ng presidente?

8536
08:22:16,860 --> 08:22:25,220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, as to the receiving of the requests, evaluation, approval, and eventual release,

8537
08:22:25,520 --> 08:22:28,300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: wala pong involvement ang Presidente.

8538
08:22:28,300 --> 08:22:30,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Walang involvement ang presidente.

8539
08:22:31,440 --> 08:22:43,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madam Speaker, and to the sponsor, pinag-uusapan po natin ay Local Government Support Fund and under that, the financial assistance to local government units.

8540
08:22:43,460 --> 08:22:43,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct.

8541
08:22:44,360 --> 08:22:44,780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

8542
08:22:45,340 --> 08:22:48,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At hindi po ba kasama ito sa lump sum funds?

8543
08:22:48,380 --> 08:22:48,820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

8544
08:22:49,720 --> 08:22:50,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: These are lump sums.

8545
08:22:51,440 --> 08:22:51,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct?

8546
08:22:53,060 --> 08:22:53,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Lump sum appropriations.

8547
08:22:54,540 --> 08:22:54,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct?

8548
08:22:54,660 --> 08:22:55,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

8549
08:22:55,640 --> 08:22:57,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: These are lump sum appropriations.

8550
08:22:57,600 --> 08:22:57,900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes.

8551
08:22:57,900 --> 08:23:06,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At tama po ba o mali na ang pagbabudgeting, ang batas sa pagbabudgeting, bukod sa General Appropriations Act,

8552
08:23:06,880 --> 08:23:16,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang umiiral na batas sa pagbabudget ay Executive Order 292, otherwise known as the Administrative Code of the Philippines.

8553
08:23:16,200 --> 08:23:16,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po.

8554
08:23:16,600 --> 08:23:16,640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ...

8555
08:23:21,540 --> 08:23:27,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Umiiral ang the provisions

8556
08:23:27,080 --> 08:23:31,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of the Administrative Code apply to budgeting.

8557
08:23:32,020 --> 08:23:32,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po.

8558
08:23:32,800 --> 08:23:33,260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

8559
08:23:33,360 --> 08:23:35,960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: EO 292 po ang batay.

8560
08:23:35,960 --> 08:23:36,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yeah.

8561
08:23:36,660 --> 08:23:37,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Including lump sum funds.

8562
08:23:38,140 --> 08:23:38,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Section.

8563
08:23:39,360 --> 08:23:42,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Puntahan po natin ang Book 6, Chapter 5, Section 35.

8564
08:23:43,820 --> 08:23:44,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

8565
08:23:44,720 --> 08:23:46,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, dapat nag-a-apply ito.

8566
08:23:46,100 --> 08:23:51,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang sabi po, Section 35, Special Budgets for Lump Sum Appropriations.

8567
08:23:52,140 --> 08:23:53,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ayun na po.

8568
08:23:53,120 --> 08:23:54,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In-establish natin lump sum to.

8569
08:23:54,480 --> 08:23:57,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, expenditures from lump sum appropriations.

8570
08:23:57,400 --> 08:24:01,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Authorized for any purpose or for any department.

8571
08:24:01,940 --> 08:24:03,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Authorized, meaning in-authorized ng Kongreso.

8572
08:24:04,340 --> 08:24:11,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For any department, office, or agency in any annual General Appropriations Act or other act.

8573
08:24:11,800 --> 08:24:14,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And from any fund of the national government.

8574
08:24:14,760 --> 08:24:21,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Shall be made in accordance with a special budget to be approved by the President.

8575
08:24:23,780 --> 08:24:24,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

8576
08:24:24,100 --> 08:24:25,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ayun lang po.

8577
08:24:25,180 --> 08:24:27,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Gusto ko lang po ma-reconcile yung sagot nyo.

8578
08:24:27,120 --> 08:24:36,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Na sabi nyo, walang anumang involvement ng President from pagtanggap hanggang pag-evaluate hanggang pag-approve hanggang pag-release.

8579
08:24:37,800 --> 08:24:47,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero sabi po sa Admin Code, very clearly, expenditures from lump sum appropriations kinakailangan to be approved by the President.

8580
08:24:49,400 --> 08:24:50,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Let me just elaborate.

8581
08:24:50,640 --> 08:24:51,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bakit po ganyan yung batas?

8582
08:24:53,700 --> 08:24:56,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Eh, ang intention po dyan, that's a safeguard.

8583
08:24:57,120 --> 08:25:08,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil nga may lump sum ka, hindi itemized dyan, in-approved ng Kongreso, as a safeguard against abuse, kailangan may pirma ng Presidente.

8584
08:25:08,520 --> 08:25:11,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At alam naman natin, pag may pirma ng Presidente, hindi basta-basta yun.

8585
08:25:11,900 --> 08:25:15,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi pipirma ang Presidente sa anumang piece of paper.

8586
08:25:16,400 --> 08:25:19,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Merong vetting, merong validation, verification, etc.

8587
08:25:19,400 --> 08:25:24,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya, importante po yung approval ng Presidente.

8588
08:25:25,960 --> 08:25:27,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano pong paliwanag?

8589
08:25:27,120 --> 08:25:34,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Parang nilalabag ang probisyon ng Admin Code sa inyong kalakaran.

8590
08:25:35,900 --> 08:25:46,380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, meron po dito din sa parehong section po, also in Section 35, Chapter 5, Book 6 of EO 292,

8591
08:25:46,820 --> 08:25:55,020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung first line po ng last sentence sa first paragraph, which says, unless otherwise provided by law.

8592
08:25:55,020 --> 08:25:56,600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In this case po,

8593
08:25:57,120 --> 08:26:16,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the GAA, through the special provision authorized by Congress, authorizes the DBM to issue the guidelines, criteria, and essentially administer the implementation of the lump sum funds.

8594
08:26:16,040 --> 08:26:26,300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron din po, relatedly, in Section 47 of EO 292, Section 47, Chapter 5, Book 6 of the same executive order,

8595
08:26:27,120 --> 08:26:35,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it provides that the Department of Budget shall administer the lump sum funds appropriated in the General Appropriations Act,

8596
08:26:35,940 --> 08:26:43,780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: except as otherwise specified therein, including the issuance of treasury warrants, covering payments to implementing agencies and other creditors,

8597
08:26:44,040 --> 08:26:45,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as may be authorized by the President.

8598
08:26:45,840 --> 08:26:56,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, may dalawa po na nagsasabi na DBM po, para pong dine-delegate ng Pangulo yung authority sa DBM,

8599
08:26:56,040 --> 08:26:58,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po sa implementation ng lump sum funds.

8600
08:26:59,120 --> 08:27:02,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, let me take the second one you mentioned. May second provision kayo.

8601
08:27:02,620 --> 08:27:08,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That only provides that the DBM administer the fund.

8602
08:27:09,000 --> 08:27:09,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba? Administer.

8603
08:27:10,040 --> 08:27:10,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, sila, tama.

8604
08:27:11,280 --> 08:27:14,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kayo, tatanggap, pwedeng mag-evaluate and so on.

8605
08:27:14,280 --> 08:27:16,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero iba yung approval.

8606
08:27:17,180 --> 08:27:20,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That doesn't talk about approval of the President.

8607
08:27:20,760 --> 08:27:21,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, that takes it first.

8608
08:27:21,740 --> 08:27:24,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi nyo, well, okay, unless otherwise,

8609
08:27:25,160 --> 08:27:25,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: expressly,

8610
08:27:26,040 --> 08:27:27,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: provided by law.

8611
08:27:27,940 --> 08:27:29,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tignan po natin

8612
08:27:29,060 --> 08:27:33,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang mga special provisions ng LGUs.

8613
08:27:33,600 --> 08:27:34,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan na po.

8614
08:27:34,400 --> 08:27:34,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan.

8615
08:27:35,080 --> 08:27:38,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Financial assistance to LGUs.

8616
08:27:39,160 --> 08:27:47,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The allocation of the financial assistance to LGUs shall be based on criteria to be developed by the DBM

8617
08:27:47,240 --> 08:27:55,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in coordination with other relevant agencies taking into consideration LGUs adherence

8618
08:27:56,040 --> 08:27:59,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to established governance standards.

8619
08:27:59,060 --> 08:28:08,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Disbursement and utilization by LGUs shall be subject to the pertinent provisions of existing government procurement laws, etc.

8620
08:28:08,920 --> 08:28:09,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: etc.

8621
08:28:10,000 --> 08:28:13,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Disbursement and utilization, etc.

8622
08:28:14,420 --> 08:28:19,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nowhere does it provide for approval.

8623
08:28:19,320 --> 08:28:22,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, wala po.

8624
08:28:22,720 --> 08:28:23,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala po.

8625
08:28:23,200 --> 08:28:24,040
