Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dagdag na hospital beds at health workers para maging regular ang mga job order and contract of service.

9966
09:35:43,280 --> 09:35:52,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pondohan ang 5.3 billion pesos na free higher education deficiency for 2026 and 2027.

9967
09:35:53,480 --> 09:35:54,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pondohan ang

9968
